<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>St. Sunday Kids Orphanage Home</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background: #1b5e20;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        section {
            background: white;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1b5e20;
        }

        .contact {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .donate {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 5px solid #ffc107;
        }

        footer {
            background: #1b5e20;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>St. Sunday Kids Orphanage Home</h1>
    <p>Giving Hope, Love and a Better Future to Children</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
        St. Sunday Kids Orphanage Home is dedicated to caring for children
        and providing them with love, support, education and a safe place
        to grow.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <div class="contact">
        <strong>Phone:</strong><br>
        +234 916 156 4976<br>
        +234 806 523 9590
    </div>
</section>

<section class="donate">
    <h2>Support the Children</h2>
    <p>
        Your support can help provide food, clothing, education,
        healthcare and other basic needs for the children.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Remitly Account Details</strong></p>
    <p>
        Account Number: 2325921440
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Thank You</h2>
    <p>
        Thank you for caring about the children and supporting our mission.
        Every contribution, no matter how small, makes a difference.
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>©️ 2026 St. Sunday Kids Orphanage Home</p>
    <p>God bless you for your support ❤️</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>